WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:34.030
Jemima picked some herbs.

2
00:00:34.031 --> 00:00:37.952
"The dinner will be lovely," she said.

3
00:00:37.953 --> 00:00:41.218
Kep, the farm dog, looked up.

4
00:00:41.219 --> 00:00:45.262
"Dinner?" he said.

5
00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:52.160
Jemima told him about the nice gentleman.

6
00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:56.198
"What does he look like?" asked Kep.

7
00:00:56.199 --> 00:01:01.396
Jemima told him.

8
00:01:01.397 --> 00:01:04.838
"Where does he live?" asked Kep.

9
00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:09.708
Jemima told him that too.

10
00:01:09.709 --> 00:01:12.491
"Hmm," said Kep.

11
00:01:12.492 --> 00:01:20.616
Then he ran off.

12
00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:30.884
Jemima flew back to the forest.

13
00:01:30.885 --> 00:01:35.628
The gentleman was sniffing the air.

14
00:01:35.629 --> 00:01:41.098
He looked nervous.

15
00:01:41.099 --> 00:01:45.102
"I have herbs for our dinner!" Jemima said.

16
00:01:45.103 --> 00:01:48.231
The fox jumped.

17
00:01:48.232 --> 00:01:56.119
"Oh, it's you," he said.

18
00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:58.683
"Get inside now!"

19
00:01:58.684 --> 00:02:02.270
Jemima gasped.

20
00:02:02.271 --> 00:02:07.076
"My friend is mean today!" she thought.

21
00:02:07.077 --> 00:02:10.433
Jemima went into the shed.

22
00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:13.492
Suddenly—wham!

23
00:02:13.493 --> 00:02:16.033
The door slammed shut.

24
00:02:16.034 --> 00:02:22.571
Jemima heard barks, growls, and howls.

25
00:02:22.572 --> 00:02:26.015
"Oh dear," she said.

26
00:02:26.016 --> 00:02:28.622
"What's going on?"

27
00:02:28.623 --> 00:02:32.877
Soon it was quiet.

28
00:02:32.878 --> 00:02:39.827
Someone opened the door.

29
00:02:39.828 --> 00:02:46.931
It was Kep.

30
00:02:46.932 --> 00:02:50.188
Kep gave Jemima a bag.

31
00:02:50.189 --> 00:02:54.194
"Put your eggs inside," he said.

32
00:02:54.195 --> 00:03:08.193
The dog took Jemima home.

33
00:03:08.194 --> 00:03:20.037
She found a new hiding spot.

34
00:03:20.038 --> 00:03:30.407
Soon she hatched some ducklings!
